    "description": "FileChooserParams.getMode\n返回文件选择器的模式，用于指示所请求的文件选择类型。\n\n@return 一个表示模式的字符串。标准值包括：\nUl(children\u003d[Li(children\u003d[P(children\u003d[CodeInline(children\u003d[Text(body\u003d\"MODE_OPEN\", children\u003d[], params\u003d{})], params\u003d{}), Text(body\u003d: 用于打开单个已存在的文件。, children\u003d[], params\u003d{})], params\u003d{})], params\u003d{}), Li(children\u003d[P(children\u003d[CodeInline(children\u003d[Text(body\u003d\"MODE_OPEN_MULTIPLE\", children\u003d[], params\u003d{})], params\u003d{}), Text(body\u003d: 用于打开多个已存在的文件。, children\u003d[], params\u003d{})], params\u003d{})], params\u003d{}), Li(children\u003d[P(children\u003d[CodeInline(children\u003d[Text(body\u003d\"MODE_SAVE\", children\u003d[], params\u003d{})], params\u003d{}), Text(body\u003d: 用于选择一个位置以保存新文件。, children\u003d[], params\u003d{})], params\u003d{})], params\u003d{})], params\u003d{})\n注意：CodeInline(children\u003d[Text(body\u003d\"MODE_OPEN_FOLDER\", children\u003d[], params\u003d{})], params\u003d{}) 等其他模式可能在某些平台版本上不可用。",
